        "operationId": "backmarketReviews",
        "summary": "Back Market product reviews",
        "description": "Customer reviews of a Back Market product (US and Australian shops), most relevant first: stars, date, text, language and country, reviewer first name and initial, what was bought and in which condition, purchase date, seller, per-aspect ratings (battery, camera, appearance, shipping …), photos, helpful votes and topics. Pass `next_cursor` back as `cursor`; null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/backmarket-reviews",
